        {
          "text": " Tunini dubbi namicha hori tissu toko ka Amosi jed'ani, ka dira Tekoa. Ganna lama, ka gaafa lafti chochoote dura, ka Uziani hayyu Yuda, ka ammalle Yeroboamuni, ilmi Yoashi, hayyu Israeli, Amosiini dubbi tana, ta waan Israeli dubbattu, daayyani arge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.1",
