          "text": " AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Worri Tiro ya maro heddu ch'ubbu hojate, tanaafi anini nyaapa worra iraa ind'owu, iti lakisa. Wonti akanatiifi worri gosa toko, ta qara wold'aqani oboleesa woli taani, dabse harka worra Edomu ka nyaapa worrati kenne. ",
