              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi anini ibida dira Raba keesa buuse, ibida suniini maneeni jajabdu dira suni ch'ufa guba. Duuba guyya suni nami guddo gohe, aka bubbe hamtu shawise woli had'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.14"
            ]
          }
